repository-code: "https://github.com/luisrosa/mechanistic-localization-is-support-relative"
abstract: >-
  Source, validation code, and provenance materials for a theory of
  mechanistic localization in which the supported internal-state domain is an
  explicit argument of the localization claim. Exact realization through a
  declared access is characterized by kernel inclusion, with consequences for
  distributed realization, support restriction, localization order, and
  cross-context compatibility.
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - neural networks
  - localization
  - support
  - circuits
  - representation
  - causal abstraction
